From: conda-forge recipe maintainers
Subject: [PATCH] Strip uv Requires-Dist, drop pyarrow cap, exclude sdist symlink

(1) Upstream lists `uv` as a `Requires-Dist` so that `pip install xorq`
bootstraps the CLI from PyPI. On conda-forge uv is packaged separately as a
native Rust binary and ships no Python `.dist-info/`, so `pip check` reports
it missing even though `$PREFIX/bin/uv` is present. It is still declared in
the recipe's `run:` block, so the conda solver pulls it in.

As of xorq 0.3.36 `git-annex` is NO LONGER a core dependency (upstream moved
it to the optional `annex` extra), so it no longer needs stripping here.

(2) Upstream caps pyarrow at <22 defensively. conda-forge currently ships
pyarrow 25, and the global pyarrow pin already constrains the ABI, so the
recipe's `run:` block deliberately carries no upper bound. Without this hunk
the wheel METADATA keeps the <22 cap and `pip check` fails with
"xorq 0.3.36 has requirement pyarrow<22,>=18.0.0, but you have pyarrow 25.0.0"
(SKILL.md G26 — loosening a conda dep does not loosen the baked wheel
metadata). This mirrors the same patch carried by
conda-forge/xorq-datafusion-feedstock.

(3) The xorq sdist ships a symlink at
`python/xorq/common/utils/tests/conftest.py` ->
`../../../backends/xorq_datafusion/tests/conftest.py`. On Windows the
extracted symlink dangles or becomes a text stub, and hatchling's wheel
builder fails `os.stat` with `WinError 123` (SKILL.md G11). Exclude the
symlinked path; the target file still ships, so pytest discovery for the
xorq_datafusion backend tests still finds a conftest.

--- a/pyproject.toml
+++ b/pyproject.toml
@@ -9,6 +9,7 @@
 # wheel ZIP).  By excluding here we ensure only force-include writes the files.
 exclude = [
     "python/xorq/env_templates/**",
+    "python/xorq/common/utils/tests/conftest.py",
 ]
 
 # .gitignore contains `.env.*` which hatchling treats as an exclusion pattern
@@ -28,7 +29,7 @@
 version = "0.3.36"
 dependencies = [
     "attrs>=24.1.0; python_version >= '3.10' and python_version < '4.0'",
-    "pyarrow>=18.0.0,<22; python_version >= '3.10' and python_version < '4.0'",
+    "pyarrow>=18.0.0; python_version >= '3.10' and python_version < '4.0'",
     "structlog>=24.2.0,<26; python_version >= '3.10' and python_version < '4.0'",
     "pandas>=2.2.3,<3 ; python_version >= '3.10' and python_version < '4.0'",
     "atpublic>=5.1",
@@ -49,7 +50,6 @@
     "prometheus-client>=0.22.1",
     "cryptography>=45.0.3",
     "strenum>=0.4.15 ; python_version <= '3.10'",
-    "uv>=0.7.20",
     "rich>=13.9.4",
     "click>=8.0",
     "gitpython>=3.1.46",
